## The Data Access Layer

The @trici/dal package is the data access layer and provides a the interface to conduct database operations. To independently
test the data access layer,the migrations are located in the __tests__/knex/migrations folder. This is a mirror of the actual migrations
folder which is location in the @trici/desktop package in the knex/migrations folder.

All the repository save methods should return the object that was saved, rather than just the id or void.

The migration files are named in the format of YYYYMMDD_001_migration_name.js. The YYYYMMDD is the timestamp(year, month, day) of the migration and the 001 is the migration number.